==English==

===Etymology===
From {{m|nl||Nieuw Haarlem|new Haarlem}}, the original {{etyl|nl|en}} name of the area, after {{m|nl|Haarlem}}, a city in the Netherlands.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[neighborhood]] in northern [[Manhattan]], currently known for its [[black]] [[population]].

